            <description><![CDATA[<h2>Ataraxia 1.2.0</h2>
<ul>
<li>Software updates: Ataraxia can now check for and install updates itself (Ataraxia → Check for Updates…, or Settings → General → Software Updates). Every update and the update feed are signed and verified before anything is installed.</li>
<li>Card buttons use the regular Liquid Glass material in Standard and Immersive Mode.</li>
<li>Announcements can have several lines.</li>
<li>The finalized light tunnel and card corners in both modes.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
